        "text": "theorem reducedStress_edge_margin {F A B c κ dA dB dR : ℝ}\n    (hF : 0 < F) (hc : 0 < c) (hr : 2 + c ≤ A + B ^ 2 / A) :\n    2 * F < (reducedStress F A B κ 0 dA dB dR).1 +\n      (B / A) * (reducedStress F A B κ 0 dA dB dR).2"
